---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, localBusinessSchema } from '../../config/site';

const procedureSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "MedicalProcedure",
  "name": "Gum Contouring",
  "description": "Cosmetic gum contouring in Houston, TX at Dentiq Dentistry.",
  "procedureType": "https://schema.org/Therapeutic",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "Dentist",
    "name": "Dentiq Dentistry",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "Houston"
    }
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Gum Contouring Houston | ${site.name}`}
  description="Cosmetic gum contouring in Houston, TX at Dentiq Dentistry."
  schema={[localBusinessSchema, procedureSchema]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary mb-4">
      <a href="/services" class="hover:underline">Services</a>
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-dark mb-4 leading-tight">
      Gum Contouring
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-neutral-mid mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Cosmetic gum contouring in Houston, TX at Dentiq Dentistry.
    </p>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed">
      <p class="mb-4">Gum contouring reshapes the gumline to improve the balance and appearance of your smile. If your gums sit too high or too low, or create an uneven frame around your teeth, this procedure can correct the contour for a more symmetrical result. At Dentiq, cosmetic dentistry shouldn't feel like a gamble — we use a clear plan to take the guesswork out of improving your smile.</p>
      
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/schedule" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Consultation</a>
      <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">View All Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Excess gum tissue can make teeth appear short or uneven, while a receding gum line can expose too much of the tooth surface</p>
      <p>Laser technology is used to precisely reshape the gums to create a more balanced and aesthetically pleasing smile</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
